  "abstract": "Comprehensive note-taking and alarm system with GPWS terrain warnings, resource monitoring, and massive performance boost",
  "description": "KerbNoteLite v1.3.0 brings major updates: Terrain Proximity Alarms (GPWS-style Pull-Up warnings, gear alerts, altitude callouts), Resource Monitoring (fuel, power, RCS tracking with customizable thresholds), Global Alarm Panel for centralized control, and 80-85% performance improvement. Features include multi-tab notebooks with unlimited tabs, location-based alarms (trigger on celestial body + situation), floating mini-notes, customizable UI skins, built-in calculator, and per-save data persistence. Never miss a mission milestone or run out of fuel again!",
